# ==========================================
# Personal-branch cleanup (October 2026)
# ==========================================
# These folders are tracked in the upstream project but kept out of
# `phuongpdse140481_FE`'s remote so the personal branch stays focused
# on the code under review. Files remain on disk locally; `git rm
# --cached` was used to drop them from the index without deleting
# them from the working tree.
#
# Removal rationale (per the October 2026 branch cleanup):
#   * .playwright-screenshots/  — generated PNGs from one-off local
#     Playwright runs; only referenced in `vite.config.ts`'s HMR
#     ignore-glob, which still works after the folder is gitignored.
#   * plans/                    — UI animation plans (Agent 4 series);
#     not imported by `src/`. Regenerable locally if needed.
#   * reports/implementation/   — implementation reports for the
#     personal branch; not imported by `src/`. Lives under the
#     already-ignored `reports/test-results/` pattern at runtime,
#     but the implementation/ subfolder wasn't covered so this entry
#     is explicit.
#   * tickets/                  — FE/BE coordination tickets; only
#     referenced from JSDoc comments in `src/*.ts` (no runtime
#     imports). The cross-reference comments survive the removal —
#     the links just point to non-existent files locally.
.playwright-screenshots/
plans/
tickets/
reports/implementation/
